{'symbol': 'EQR', 'date': '2022-11-10 17:30:00', 'title': 'EQUITY RESIDENTIAL TO PARTICIPATE IN NAREIT REITWORLD ANNUAL CONFERENCE', 'text': "CHICAGO--( BUSINESS WIRE )--EQUITY RESIDENTIAL (NYSE: EQR) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT MEMBERS OF THE COMPANY'S SENIOR MANAGEMENT TEAM, INCLUDING THE COMPANY'S PRESIDENT AND CEO, MARK J. PARRELL, WILL PARTICIPATE IN THE NAREIT REITWORLD ANNUAL CONFERENCE ON TUESDAY AND WEDNESDAY, NOVEMBER 15 AND 16, 2022. IN CONNECTION WITH THIS EVENT, THE COMPANY HAS ISSUED AN INVESTOR UPDATE WHICH CAN BE FOUND IN THE INVESTOR SECTION OF THE COMPANY'S WEBSITE AT WWW.EQUITYAPARTMENTS.COM."}